1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,197
Zero order.

2
00:00:01,197 --> 00:00:04,218
Ammonia decomposes on a hot tungsten wire.

3
00:00:04,218 --> 00:00:09,244
Every active spot on the metal surface is already covered by an ammonia molecule.

4
00:00:09,244 --> 00:00:13,802
Adding more ammonia gas does nothing: the queue just gets longer.

5
00:00:13,802 --> 00:00:15,664
The rate is simply k.

